# Krateo Blueprint — Google Cloud [[.ServiceTitle]] [[.KccKind]]

> Generated by `tools/kccgen` from the Config Connector `[[.KccKind]]` CRD (`[[.Group]]`).

Provisions a Google Cloud [[.ServiceTitle]] **[[.KccKind]]** through
[Config Connector](https://cloud.google.com/config-connector/docs/overview). The chart renders a
native `[[.Group]]/[[.KccVersion]]` `[[.KccKind]]` resource; the Config Connector controller
reconciles it into the real Google Cloud resource and reports status back.

Once the `CompositionDefinition` is applied, every `[[.CompKind]]` Composition you create
becomes a Google Cloud [[.KccKind]].

Upstream stability level of this resource: **[[.Stability]]**.

## Prerequisites

- **Config Connector installed** in the cluster — see
  [`../../../docs/installing-controllers.md`](../../../docs/installing-controllers.md).
- **Google Cloud credentials configured** — Workload Identity (recommended) or a service-account
  key, plus a `ConfigConnectorContext` in the target namespace. See
  [`../../../docs/authentication.md`](../../../docs/authentication.md).
- Krateo `core-provider` installed.

## Configuration

Composition `spec` fields **mirror the Config Connector [[.KccKind]] spec**. Full schema in
[`chart/values.schema.json`](chart/values.schema.json). The extra `projectId` field sets the
`cnrm.cloud.google.com/project-id` annotation; leave it empty to inherit the project from the
namespace, or when the spec already carries a `projectRef`.

## How to install

```sh
kubectl create namespace [[.Namespace]]
kubectl apply -f compositiondefinition.yaml   # publishes the [[.CompKind]] type
kubectl apply -f customform.yaml              # optional: portal card + form
```

This publishes a `[[.CompKind]]` Composition type (`composition.krateo.io/[[.CompVersion]]`,
plural `[[.CompPlural]]`), pulling the chart from
`oci://ghcr.io/krateo-blueprints/charts/[[.ChartName]]`.

### Create a Composition

```yaml
apiVersion: composition.krateo.io/[[.CompVersion]]
kind: [[.CompKind]]
metadata:
  name: my-[[.Slug]]
  namespace: [[.Namespace]]
spec:
  projectId: my-gcp-project
  # ... [[.KccKind]] spec fields (see values.schema.json)
```

### Check status

```sh
kubectl get [[.CompPlural]].composition.krateo.io -n [[.Namespace]]
kubectl get [[.KccKindLower]]s.[[.Group]] -A
```
